10 REM NESTED GOSUB (A BAYSICK EXTENSION: THE 1964 SYSTEM ALLOWED ONE LEVEL)
20 PRINT "MAIN START"
30 GOSUB 100
40 PRINT "MAIN AGAIN"
50 GOSUB 200
60 PRINT "MAIN END"
70 STOP
100 PRINT " IN 100"
110 GOSUB 200
120 PRINT " BACK IN 100"
130 RETURN
200 PRINT "  IN 200"
210 GOSUB 300
220 PRINT "  BACK IN 200"
230 RETURN
300 PRINT "   IN 300, DEPTH TEST"
310 RETURN
400 END
